  "solution_ref": "$a_6+a_8=0$ → $a_1=-6d$ ($d>0$). $\\sum\\frac1{a_ka_{k+1}}=\\frac1d\\left(\\frac1{a_1}-\\frac1{a_6}\\right)=\\frac5{a_1(a_1+5d)}=\\frac5{96}$ → $a_1(a_1+5d)=96$ → $6d^2=96$, $d=4$, $a_1=-24$. $\\sum_{k=1}^{15}a_k=\\frac{15(-48+56)}2=60$",
